* Edit 2: Cascode structure (common-gate NMOS + PMOS cascode) for higher output impedance.
* NM1 (common-gate input) drives PMOS cascode (PM1), loaded by L2. Output at PM1 drain.
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 VSS VSS
PMOS PM1 n3 n1 n2 VDD
L L2 n3 VDD
C C2 n3 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n4
NMOS NM3 n4 n4 VSS VSS
R R2 n4 n1
C Cbyp n1 VSS